Since $\angle ABC + \angle ABD = 180^\circ$ because $\angle ABC$ and $\angle ABD$ are supplementary, and given that $\angle ABD = 150^\circ$, then $\angle ABC = 180^\circ - 150^\circ = 30^\circ$. [asy]
